litert: support 0-runtime-input, 5D, and rank-2 TRANSPOSE

Adds TransposeConstantData constant folding, perm size 5 support via
Transpose3DAttributes, and aligns the rank-2 constant-fold shape with
the ExtractTensorShape convention (BHWC(D0,1,1,D1)).

